<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Oct 24.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Oct 24.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>No milling wheat 11 pct protein trade was reported.</p>
<p>Feed wheat Norfolk/Suffolk Oct 102.50.</p>
<p>Liverpool Feb 106.00 Mar 107.00.</p>
<p>Southampton Oct 101.00.</p>
<p>Tilbury Nov 102.00/102.50.</p>
<p>East Devon Jan/Mar 104.50.</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk Dec 101.00.</p>
<p>Suffolk/Essex Nov 102.50.</p>
<p>Preston Nov 102.50.</p>
</text>
